---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import { site, waLink } from "../content/site";
import { withBase } from "@sites/kit";
---

<section id="programari" class="section">
  <div class="container-page book">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2 class="heading-lg">Programează-te</h2>
      <p class="book__lead muted">
        Scrie-mi pe WhatsApp sau sună-mă, spune-mi ce serviciu te interesează și îți confirm programarea în cel mai
        scurt timp.
      </p>

      <div class="card good">
        <p class="label-md good__label">Bun de știut</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Programarea devine fermă după mesajul meu de confirmare pe WhatsApp.</li>
          <li>
            Te rog anunță-mă cu minimum <strong>24 de ore</strong> înainte dacă vrei să anulezi sau să reprogramezi.
          </li>
          <li>
            Detalii complete în <a href={withBase("/termeni/")}>Termeni și condiții</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal">
      <!-- Primary action: WhatsApp. The page's single success metric, so it
           gets the strongest affordance: solid green fill, the recognizable
           glyph, and a "fastest reply" reassurance. -->
      <a href={waLink()} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-whatsapp wa-card" data-booking-cta>
        <span class="wa-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <Icon name="ph:whatsapp-logo" size={24} aria-hidden="true" />
        </span>
        <span>
          <b>Scrie-mi pe WhatsApp</b>
          <span class="wa-card__line">Răspund cel mai repede aici</span>
          <span class="wa-card__line num">{site.phone}</span>
        </span>
        <Icon name="ph:arrow-right" size={20} aria-hidden="true" />
      </a>

      <!-- Fallback: phone. Deliberately quieter so it reads as the
           alternative, not a peer of the WhatsApp action. -->
      <p class="book__or label-md muted">sau, dacă preferi</p>
      <a href={`tel:+${site.phoneE164}`} class="call-wide">
        <Icon name="ph:phone" size={20} aria-hidden="true" />
        <span>Sună-mă</span>
        <span class="num muted">{site.phone}</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .book {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .book__lead {
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .good {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .good__label {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .good ul {
    margin-top: 0.625rem;
    font-size: var(--text-label);
    line-height: 1.375rem;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
  }

  .good li + li {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .good a {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
  }

  .wa-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr 1.25rem;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .wa-card__icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-on-whatsapp-wash);
  }

  .wa-card b {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25rem;
  }

  .wa-card__line {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--text-label);
    line-height: var(--text-label--line-height);
  }

  .num {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .book__or {
    margin: 1rem 0 0.75rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .call-wide {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    min-height: 3.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-container-lowest);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-outline);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .call-wide:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-on-surface);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .book {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .wa-card {
      grid-template-columns: 2.75rem 1fr 1.25rem;
      padding: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
